# OS / editor-local files
.DS_Store
.cursor/
.secrets/

# Rust intermediates: safe to delete; never use target/ as the release store
**/target/
/Cargo.lock

# Generated output. Keep intentionally retained local binaries in
# <tool>/out/<target-triple>/<binary>; publish release artifacts via Jenkins/R2.
**/out/

# Python tooling and caches
**/.venv/
**/__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
**/.pytest_cache/
**/.mypy_cache/
**/.ruff_cache/

# Browser automation sessions, screenshots, and console logs
**/.playwright-mcp/

# Documentation policy
*.md
!README.md
!README_CN.md
!CLAUDE.md
!docs/**/*.md
!**/docs/**/*.md

# Runtime data / local backups
**/workbench_data_*/
crates/murmur/data/
chat.ctx
prompt_context.txt
*.bak
*.bak2

# Generated test-output media
**/tests/**/output*.mp4
